    return {'status':'inconclusive','answer':f'No physical activation outcome at 41.2 Hz was observed. The procedure only oscillated between menu readings at {sorted(set(f for _,f in freqs))} Hz (observations {indices}); it never reached the requested setting, so the low-range activation possibility remains untested. This is a procedure/navigation failure, not evidence that activation fails at 41.2 Hz. Next, repair the controller to decrement monotonically from the live reading and record the physical outcome at exactly 41.2 Hz.','evidence':[i for i,_ in freqs]}

